{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["对耶路撒冷和犹大的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["看啊，主——万军之耶和华要从耶路撒冷和犹大拿去众人倚靠的一切：粮食、水、"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"英雄、战士、审判官、先知、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"占卜者、长老、","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五十夫长、显贵、谋士、巧匠和巫师。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主必使少儿做他们的首领，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让孩童治理他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓将彼此欺凌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"邻居互相争斗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少年目无尊长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卑贱者欺尊犯上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，人会拉住一位同族的弟兄说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你有外衣穿，你做我们的首领吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这废墟之地就交给你了！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但那人必高声说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我救不了你们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我家中无衣无食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要让我做百姓的首领。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷崩溃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大败落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们的言行冒犯耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蔑视荣耀的主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的表情显出他们心术不正，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们跟所多玛人一样对自己的罪恶津津乐道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不隐瞒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必大祸临头，自招灾难。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要告诉义人：他们必有福乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们必吃自己行为结出的果子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶人有祸了！他们必大祸临头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因恶行而遭报应。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我的子民啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"孩童欺压你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"妇女管辖你们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的首领领你们入迷途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带你们走歧路。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华准备就绪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要起来审判祂的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必审问祂子民中的长老和首领，对他们说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“就是你们毁坏了我的葡萄园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"家里堆着从穷人那里掠夺的东西。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们为何压榨我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"碾磨贫穷人的脸？”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主——万军之耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华又说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“锡安的女子狂傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"昂首走路，卖弄媚眼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"俏步徐行，脚镯叮当。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要使她们头上长疮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"前额光秃。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["到那日，主必拿去她们美丽的脚镯、发饰、项链、"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耳环、手镯、面纱、"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["头饰、脚链、彩带、香盒、护身符、"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["戒指、鼻环、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["礼服、外袍、披肩、钱包、"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["镜子、内衣、头巾和围巾。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"她们的香气被臭味取代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"腰带被绳子取代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"美发被秃头取代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"华服被麻衣取代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"美颜被烙印取代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城中的男子将丧身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士将战死沙场。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锡安的城门必悲伤、哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锡安必坐在地上，空空荡荡。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}